  "ruleText": "Ed 212.03 Final Decision. All interested parties shall be notified of the board's final decision in writing and shall be provided with a copy of the decision by certified mail within 10 days after the date such decision is made.\n\nSource. #8334-A, eff 4-23-05 (from Ed 213.03)",
